\pard\sa160\f0\fs26
{\b Try ArrowKeys}
\par Open Karabiner-Elements in Applications and complete its keyboard and driver permission prompts. Then open TextEdit, type a word, hold Caps Lock and tap J to move left.
\par To disable ArrowKeys, open Karabiner-Elements \u8594? Complex Modifications and remove the ArrowKeys rule. To enable it for another account, open {\b /Library/Application Support/ArrowKeys/Enable ArrowKeys.command} while signed in to that account.
\par To uninstall ArrowKeys, open {\b Applications \u8594? Uninstall ArrowKeys.command}.
}
